# Scaffolds generated by running `lalibela` locally for manual testing land
# in the repo root (whatever -name was used) and have repeatedly been
# committed by accident (b/, fgd/, gf/, el/ have all shown up this way).
# Prefer testing outside the repo (e.g. cd /tmp && lalibela ...); as a
# backstop, name local test scaffolds with a .lalibela-test prefix so they're
# always ignored, and the known past offenders are listed explicitly.
.lalibela-test*/
/b/
/fgd/
/gf/
/el/
